			description: [
				"&d&o\"Every dreamer carries a power. Which one is yours?\""
				""
				"&7The RPG series adds four classes. Each has its own &eworkbench&7, weapons, armor and &espells&7. Weapons show their spells in their tooltip; the spells appear on a &espell hotbar&7 above your item bar."
				"&7You may follow one path or all of them."
